ing late or give up a chance to finally be noticed?"}, {"s": 38.12, "e": 41.12, "zh": "没问题，加载视频，发一条完美的聊天消息。", "en": "Not a prob, load the vid, post the perfect chat message."}, {"s": 41.36, "e": 42.36, "zh": "正好准时。", "en": "Right on time."}, {"s": 42.5, "e": 43.34, "zh": "嘿老板。", "en": "Hey boss."}, {"s": 44.04, "e": 45.68, "zh": "上午10点。办公室咖啡。", "en": "10AM. Office coffee."}, {"s": 45.76, "e": 46.48, "zh": "蛋白棒。", "en": "Protein bar."}, {"s": 46.56, "e": 47.14, "zh": "MacBook 放上 dock。", "en": "Dock the MacBook."}, {"s": 47.36, "e": 47.86, "zh": "转接头。", "en": "Dongle."}, {"s": 47.98, "e": 48.54, "zh": "Yubikey。", "en": "Yubikey."}, {"s": 48.64, "e": 49.36, "zh": "我上线了。", "en": "I'm on."}, {"s": 49.36, "e": 50.36, "zh": "该开站会了。", "en": "Time for standup."}, {"s": 50.36, "e": 51.08, "zh": "回到工位。", "en": "Back to the desk."}, {"s": 51.2, "e": 52.72, "zh": "诀窍是，我一直站着。", "en": "Trick is, I'm always standing."}, {"s": 52.84, "e": 56.3, "zh": "得装最新的安全补丁，才能符合公司合规要求？", "en": "Gotta install the latest security patches to stay compliant with corporate policy?"}, {"s": 56.34, "e": 56.84, "zh": "马上办。", "en": "On it."}, {"s": 56.84, "e": 58.24, "zh": "等的时候顺便看看 Robinhood。", "en": "Check the Robinhood while I’m waiting."}, {"s": 58.46, "e": 60.0, "zh": "全红。果然如此。", "en": "All red. Just what I thought."}, {"s": 60.36, "e": 62.28, "zh": "11点半。新闻推送。特朗普。", "en": "11:30. News blast. Trump."}, {"s": 62.64, "e": 64.54, "zh": "我已经在 Twitter 上发了个犀利观点。", "en": "I'm already on Twitter with a hot take."}, {"s": 64.64, "e": 65.66, "zh": "然后就到午饭时间了。", "en": "Then it's lunchtime."}, {"s": 65.66, "e": 66.74, "zh": "纯素肉酱面。", "en": "Vegan bolognese."}, {"s": 66.74, "e": 69.2, "zh": "一个人坐。没空闲聊。", "en": "Sit alone. No time for idle chatter."}, {"s": 69.24, "e": 71.62, "zh": "一本 moleskine 加写点积极肯定语，就够了。", "en": "A moleskine and writing positive affirmations is all I need."}, {"s": 72.18, "e": 74.04, "zh": "转眼就晚上8点半了。", "en": "Next thing I know, it's 8:30PM."}, {"s": 74.04, "e": 75.2, "zh": "该收工了。", "en": "Time to call it a day."}, {"s": 75.66, "e": 76.5, "zh": "又坐上7号线。", "en": "Back on the 7."}, {"s": 76.62, "e": 78.06, "zh": "这次往 uptown 方向。", "en": "This time goin' uptown."}, {"s": 78.22, "e": 78.78, "zh": "欢乐时光。", "en": "Happy hour."}, {"s": 78.88, "e": 79.38, "zh": "一个人。", "en": "Alone."}, {"s": 79.54, "e": 80.82, "zh": "11美元的金汤力。", "en": "11 dollar gin and tonic."}, {"s": 81.0, "e": 81.68, "zh": "再来一杯。", "en": "Another one."}, {"s": 81.84, "e": 82.7, "zh": "感觉不错。", "en": "Feelin' good."}, {"s": 82.72, "e": 83.88, "zh": "不跟任何人说话。", "en": "Don't talk to anyone."}, {"s": 84.0, "e": 84.84, "zh": "刷刷 Insta。", "en": "Check the Insta."}, {"s": 85.0, "e": 85.76, "zh": "100个赞。", "en": "100 likes."}, {"s": 85.86, "e": 88.2, "zh": "不错。但我会更好的。", "en": "Not bad. But I'll have better."}, {"s": 88.34, "e": 90.58, "zh": "城市的灯光把我的生物钟搞乱了。", "en": "City lights have my circadian rhythm screwed up."}, {"s": 90.72, "e": 92.7, "zh": "得在情况变糟之前回家。", "en": "Gotta head home before it gets too bad."}, {"s": 92.82, "e": 93.72, "zh": "回到床上。", "en": "Back in bed."}, {"s": 94.0, "e": 96.56, "zh": "在Nook上读一章马可·奥勒留的《沉思录》。", "en": "One chapter of Marcus Aurelius' Meditations on the Nook."}, {"s": 96.72, "e": 97.8, "zh": "啥也没看懂。", "en": "Didn't understand shit."}, {"s": 97.98, "e": 100.18, "zh": "趁电池耗尽前发一条引用推文，结束这一天。", "en": "Tweet a quote just as the battery dies for the day."}, {"s": 100.38, "e": 101.22, "zh": "完美。", "en": "Perfect."}, {"s": 101.76, "e": 103.88, "zh": "该进入我多相睡眠周期的第一阶段了。", "en": "Time for phase one of my polyphasic sleep cycle."}, {"s": 103.96, "e": 106.26, "zh": "明天是我间歇性断食计划的第一天。", "en": "Tomorrow’s day 1 of my intermittent fasting routine."}, {"s": 106.86, "e": 107.92, "zh": "这就是一天的活儿。", "en": "All in a day's work."}]}